    "name":  "Pendant Lamp - VINTAGE LINEN ROPE - for E27",
    "reference":  "91750",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHanging\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eRope\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eLamp\u003c/strong\u003e made of \u003cstrong\u003elinen\u003c/strong\u003e for mounting on ceilings, \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e socket, combine them with our vintage filament bulbs to create retro environments. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis braided rope textile lamp is easy to install and comes with all the necessary accessories for assembly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBULBS NOT INCLUDED.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLinen Pendant Lamp E27\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003elinen rope pendant lamp \u003c/strong\u003ewith\u003cstrong\u003e E27\u003c/strong\u003e socket is a unique and elegant lighting piece that fits well with a variety of decorative styles, events or parties, from rustic to modern. This lamp is composed of a braided linen cord that extends from the ceiling and terminates in an E27 socket to hold the bulb.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe E27 socket is one of the most common socket types and is used all over the world. It is easy to install and can accommodate a wide variety of bulbs, including LED, fluorescent and halogen bulbs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe linen rope pendant light with E27 socket is an excellent choice for those who want pleasant, natural lighting that creates a soft, relaxing ambiance. The \u003cstrong\u003elinen rope\u003c/strong\u003e creates an attractive visual effect and the E27 socket allows for easy customization of the light, allowing the right bulb to be used for the desired ambiance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn conclusion, this E27 socket \u003cstrong\u003eceiling pendant\u003c/strong\u003e rope light is an elegant and unique lamp that can add a touch of style and personality to any interior space. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of E27 Linen Rope Pendant Lamp:\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHomes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStores\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBars\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCafeterias\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestaurants\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHotels\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEvents\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
